# Review guidelines

## TypeScript

- Flag `any`, bare `@ts-ignore`, empty interfaces that should be clearer types.

## Exports & files

- Flag `export default`.
- Flag non-kebab-case file names.

## React / RN

- Flag class components.
- Flag `React.FC`.
- Flag missing list keys or index-only keys on dynamic lists.

## Architecture

- Flag MQTT/IR usage from `apps/mobile` or `apps/telegram-bot`.
- Flag direct `fetch` in components instead of `api-client`.
- Flag UI copy that asserts real AC power from IR-only sends.

## Quality & security

- Flag secrets, hardcoded credentials, real Telegram IDs.
- Flag `.only` / unexplained `.skip` in tests.
- Flag PRs that mix unrelated scopes (e.g. firmware + Expo) without justification.
